From: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Carry stereo content protocol version 6

The width of the selected output precedes each delivery of its depth limits.
Keep every request and event of the earlier versions.

Assisted-by: GPT-6 (Codex)

